<title>CANADA: Canadian gas storage survey - note to subscribers.</title>
<headline>Canadian gas storage survey - note to subscribers.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data for the Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage could not be collected this week because of the Christmas and New Year holiday, the CGA said on Friday.</p>
<p>The CGA said its next report would be released the week of January 10.</p>
<p>The last survey was reported by Reuters on December 20 and included data for the week of December 13. ((-- Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
